  "notes": {
    "manas-2010:p0018:b002:l010": "The whip-measure is preserved literally; its precise historical allocation practice needs review.",
    "manas-2010:p0018:b002:l015": "асый denotes mature large livestock (fifth year and onward); species is not specified here. Rendered full-grown beast rather than inventing a species.",
    "manas-2010:p0018:b002:l026": "Астын бапан is uncertain. Draft follows the dispersal sense attested for the formula башы бапан, аягы сапан. Check the archival wording; not treated as a confirmed military title.",
    "manas-2010:p0019:b002:l009": "мас is literally drunk/intoxicated; bewildered is a contextual reading for the helpless young children and requires specialist review.",
    "manas-2010:p0019:b002:l039": "ак үйлүү can refer to wealth/white yurts or a hostage institution. Master of the white yurts is provisional in this context; compare the hostage sense on PDF page 22.",
    "manas-2010:p0020:b002:l004": "Чампан retained as Champan; referent unresolved.",
    "manas-2010:p0020:b002:l018": "ыймандаш refers to sharing faith; prayers of faith renders the parallel death clause, pending cultural review."
  }
